  "summary": "harmony-app-toolkit exfiltrates host data via hex-obfuscated preinstall script",
  "details": "The package declares a preinstall lifecycle script (preinstall.js) that reads a hex-encoded command from preinstall.json, decodes it with Buffer.from(hex,'hex'), and passes the result to child_process.exec. The decoded command shells out via curl to https://eousft8gflamm91.m.pipedream.net and POSTs the output of whoami, pwd, hostname, and the contents of /etc/passwd from the installing host. The behavior runs automatically on npm install, uses hex encoding to hide the payload string, and sends installer host identity and a system account file to an attacker-controlled Pipedream endpoint.",
